# This directory holds small sample CSV recordings produced by
# experiment 08 (save_scan_to_csv) and replayed by experiment 09
# (replay_recorded_scan). Commit short samples here so other people can
# run the offline experiments without having a LiDAR plugged in.
#
# Large recordings (more than a few megabytes) should not be committed;
# regenerate them locally. The repo's .gitignore lets through any file
# matching `sample_*.csv` but excludes everything under data/recordings/.
